# Copy to backend/.env and fill in the real values locally.
# backend/.env is git-ignored. NEVER commit real credentials.

# --- Database / Supabase ---
# Use Supabase's TRANSACTION pooler (port 6543), not the session pooler / direct port (5432):
#   - 5432 (session mode): each backend connection holds a Supabase connection for as long as
#     it is open. With pool_size 15 shared by everything, heavy work such as the D365 sync can
#     run out ("EMAXCONNSESSION max clients reached in session mode").
#   - 6543 (transaction mode): a Supabase connection is only used while a query or transaction
#     runs, then returned, so many more requests share the same limit. This backend does not
#     use session-only features (LISTEN/NOTIFY, session SET, advisory locks, named prepared
#     statements), so transaction mode is safe for it.
# Copy the "Transaction pooler" string from Supabase -> Project Settings -> Database, e.g.:
#   postgresql://postgres.<project-ref>:<password>@aws-0-<region>.pooler.supabase.com:6543/postgres
# DATABASE_URL=

# Connection pool inside this backend (optional; these are the defaults):
#   DB_POOL_MAX - most connections this backend keeps open (leaves room for scripts and tools)
#   DB_CONNECTION_TIMEOUT_MS - how long a request waits for a free connection before it gets
#                              a "system is busy" (503) answer instead of hanging
# DB_POOL_MAX=5
# DB_CONNECTION_TIMEOUT_MS=10000
# SUPABASE_URL=
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
# EMAIL_USER=
# EMAIL_PASS=
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
# AUTH_TOKEN_SECRET=

# --- D365 Finance & Operations service-to-service integration ---
# HTTPS environment ROOT url only: no path, no trailing slash needed, no query.
# Finance & Operations root URL (NOT a *.crm.dynamics.com URL).
# Example shape only - use the value observed in your browser:
#   https://<env-name>.<region>.axcloud.dynamics.com
# D365_BASE_URL=

# Microsoft Entra ID tenant. Accepts the tenant (directory) GUID or the tenant domain.
# D365_TENANT_ID=

# Entra app registration -> Application (client) ID.
# D365_CLIENT_ID=

# Entra app registration -> Certificates & secrets -> client secret VALUE
# (the secret value, not the secret ID).
# D365_CLIENT_SECRET=

# HRMS -> D365 push kill switch. Set to false to stop pushing HRMS edits to D365
# (the D365 -> HRMS pull sync is unaffected). Defaults to enabled.
# D365_PUSH_ENABLED=true
